OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2000FPeter Sissons presents the final
OL,7,Fedition of the BBC News at Nine. The
OL,8,Fprogramme was launched on 14th
OL,9,FSeptember 1970.
OL,10,
OL,11,FSissons ended the final edition with
OL,12,Fthe words: "That is, or rather that
OL,13,Fwas, the Nine o'Clock News. From
OL,14,FMonday, it's me or Michael Buerk as
OL,15,Fusual, but with the BBC Ten o'Clock
OL,16,FNews. Until then, from us all,
OL,17,Fgoodnight."
